# User Interaction Model - Read-Only Portal

## Core Principle: Content Consumption Only

This Poetry Slam members area is a **read-only portal** where users consume information without any interactive features.

## What Users DO

### ✅ View Information
- **Browse competition data** - Rounds, participants, results
- **Read news and updates** - Stay informed about slam events
- **Access city tips** - Location recommendations and venue info
- **Check timetables** - Event schedules and timing
- **Navigate content** - Browse through different sections

### ✅ Real-time Updates
- **Live data refresh** - Automatic updates every 30 seconds
- **Status indicators** - Real-time competition status
- **Countdown timers** - Event countdowns and deadlines

## What Users DON'T DO

### ❌ No User Registration
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T create user registration
const registerUser = async (userData) => {
  // No user registration system
};
```

### ❌ No Content Creation
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T allow user content creation
const createPost = async (content) => {
  // No user-generated content
};
```

### ❌ No Interactive Features
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T create interactive features
const likePost = async (postId) => {
  // No likes, comments, or interactions
};

const submitForm = async (formData) => {
  // No user input forms
};
```

### ❌ No Social Features
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T create social features
const followUser = async (userId) => {
  // No following, sharing, or social interactions
};
```

## Component Patterns

### ✅ Display Components
```javascript
// ✅ Information display
function ParticipantCard({ participant }) {
  return (
    <div className="participant-card">
      <h3>{participant.name}</h3>
      <p>{participant.region}</p>
      <p>{participant.instagram}</p>
    </div>
  );
}

// ✅ Navigation components
function NavigationMenu() {
  return (
    <nav>
      <Link to="/participants">Participants</Link>
      <Link to="/rounds">Rounds</Link>
      <Link to="/news">News</Link>
    </nav>
  );
}
```

### ❌ Interactive Components
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T create interactive components
function CommentForm() {
  // No comment forms
}

function LikeButton() {
  // No like buttons
}

function ShareButton() {
  // No share buttons
}
```

## Data Flow

### ✅ Consumption Only
```javascript
// ✅ Simple data fetching
const { data: participants } = useQuery(['participants'], fetchParticipants);
const { data: rounds } = useQuery(['rounds'], fetchRounds);
const { data: news } = useQuery(['news'], fetchNews);

// ✅ Display data
return (
  <div>
    <ParticipantsList participants={participants} />
    <RoundsList rounds={rounds} />
    <NewsList news={news} />
  </div>
);
```

### ❌ No Data Modification
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T allow data modification
const updateParticipant = async (id, data) => {
  // No user data modification
};

const deleteNews = async (id) => {
  // No user content deletion
};
```

## Admin vs User Experience

### Admin Panel (Interactive)
```javascript
// ✅ Admin can create/edit content
function AdminParticipantForm() {
  const [formData, setFormData] = useState({});
  
  const handleSubmit = async (data) => {
    await createParticipant(data);
  };
  
  return (
    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>
      <input name="name" />
      <button type="submit">Create</button>
    </form>
  );
}
```

### User Portal (Read-Only)
```javascript
// ✅ Users only view content
function ParticipantCard({ participant }) {
  return (
    <div>
      <h3>{participant.name}</h3>
      <p>{participant.region}</p>
    </div>
  );
}
```

## Benefits

- **Simple UX** - Users focus on consuming information
- **Fast Performance** - No complex interactions to slow down
- **Easy Maintenance** - No user-generated content to manage
- **Clear Purpose** - Information portal, not social platform
- **Secure** - No user input means fewer security concerns

## Implementation Guidelines

### ✅ Do Create
- **Information displays** - Cards, lists, detail views
- **Navigation** - Menu-based content browsing
- **Real-time updates** - Live data synchronization
- **Responsive design** - Mobile-friendly consumption

### ❌ Don't Create
- **User forms** - No input fields or submissions
- **Interactive features** - No likes, comments, or interactions
- **Social features** - No following, sharing, or social elements
- **User accounts** - No registration or login for users

## Remember

This is a **Poetry Slam members area** focused on:
- **Competition information** - Rounds, participants, results
- **Event updates** - News, announcements, schedules
- **Location guidance** - City tips, venue information
- **Real-time status** - Live competition updates

**Users browse, read, and stay informed - they don't create, modify, or interact with content.**